{"sha": "887e547fef4a8b6bfe709f41fedee52668c8bb57415d1717c0e23c706470c51e", "body": ["\\section{稳态：热阻}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[平板的热阻]\\label{prop:b2:heat-conduction:resistance}", "在无源的稳态下，厚度为 $e$、", "面积为 $S$、热导率为 $\\lambda$ 的平板，位于温度 $T_1$ 与", "$T_2$ 之间，温度分布为线性，并携带热流量", "\\[", "\\Phi = \\frac{T_1 - T_2}{R_{\\text{th}}}, \\qquad", "R_{\\text{th}} = \\frac{e}{\\lambda S}\\quad\\text{（单位 \\unit{K/W}）} :", "\\]", "称其为\\emph{热阻}\\index{热阻}。温度", "扮演电势的角色，热流量则扮演电流的角色：串联的热阻", "（如墙的各层）相加，并联的热阻（如墙与", "窗）则取倒数相加。对于圆柱壳（如管道的", "保温层），内、外半径分别为 $r_1 < r_2$、长为 $\\ell$，", "$R_{\\text{th}} = \\ln(r_2/r_1)/2\\pi\\lambda\\ell$；对于球壳，", "$(1/r_1 - 1/r_2)/4\\pi\\lambda$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "$\\dd^2T/\\dd x^2 = 0$：温度呈仿射分布，$j_Q = \\lambda(T_1 - T_2)/e$", "为均匀量，$\\Phi = j_QS$。在圆柱几何中，$\\Phi = -\\lambda\\,2\\pi", "r\\ell\\,\\dd T/\\dd r$ 对每个 $r$ 都相同（无积累），故", "$T = A - (\\Phi/2\\pi\\lambda\\ell)\\ln r$；在球几何中，$\\Phi =", "-4\\pi r^2\\lambda\\,\\dd T/\\dd r$ 给出 $T = A + \\Phi/4\\pi\\lambda r$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[与流体的交换：牛顿定律]\\label{prop:b2:heat-conduction:newton}", "温度为 $T_{\\text{s}}$ 的固体表面与流体接触，流体温度为 $T_{\\text{f}}$", "（远离表面处），损失的热流密度为", "\\[", "j_Q = h\\,(T_{\\text{s}} - T_{\\text{f}}) ,", "\\]", "其中\\emph{传热系数}\\index{传热", "系数} $h$（单位 \\unit{W/m^2/K}）综合了通过", "紧贴壁面的薄流体层的传导，以及不断更新该层的", "对流：对于空气，$h \\approx 5$--\\qty{25}{W/m^2/K}，自然对流或", "弱对流时；强制对流时为 $50$--\\qty{500}{W/m^2/K}，", "对于水为 $10^3$--$10^4$。此外，表面还附加一个\\emph{膜热阻}，", "$1/hS$，与壁面串联。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "唯象地处理：不计算流体的运动，而将其概括在", "$h$ 中（由测量得到，或由流体力学的关联式给出）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.9, >=stealth]", "  % wall layers", "  \\fill[omExo!15] (0,0) rectangle (1.6,2.6);", "  \\fill[omDef!12] (1.6,0) rectangle (2.6,2.6);", "  \\fill[gray!15] (2.6,0) rectangle (2.8,2.6);", "  \\draw (0,0) rectangle (2.8,2.6);", "  \\draw (1.6,0) -- (1.6,2.6); \\draw (2.6,0) -- (2.6,2.6);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (0.8,2.85) {砖};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize] at (2.1,2.85) {玻璃棉};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, right] at (2.9,1.3) {室内 $T_{\\text{i}}$};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, left] at (-0.1,1.3) {室外 $T_{\\text{o}}$};", "  \\draw[->, omThm, thick] (3.6,0.7) -- (-0.8,0.7) node[midway, below, font=\\scriptsize] {$\\Phi$};", "  % resistor chain", "  \\begin{scope}[yshift=-1.6cm]", "    \\draw (-0.8,0) -- (0.2,0);", "    \\draw (0.2,-0.18) rectangle (1.0,0.18); \\node[font=\\tiny] at (0.6,0) {$1/h_{\\text{o}}S$};", "    \\draw (1.0,0) -- (1.4,0);", "    \\draw (1.4,-0.18) rectangle (2.4,0.18); \\node[font=\\tiny] at (1.9,0) {$e_1/\\lambda_1 S$};", "    \\draw (2.4,0) -- (2.8,0);", "    \\draw (2.8,-0.18) rectangle (3.8,0.18); \\node[font=\\tiny] at (3.3,0) {$e_2/\\lambda_2 S$};", "    \\draw (3.8,0) -- (4.2,0);", "    \\draw (4.2,-0.18) rectangle (5.0,0.18); \\node[font=\\tiny] at (4.6,0) {$1/h_{\\text{i}}S$};", "    \\draw (5.0,0) -- (5.6,0);", "    \\fill (-0.8,0) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\scriptsize] {$T_{\\text{o}}$};", "    \\fill (5.6,0) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\scriptsize] {$T_{\\text{i}}$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % profile", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7.2cm]", "    \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (3.4,0) node[right, font=\\scriptsize] {$x$};", "    \\draw[->] (0,0) -- (0,2.8) node[above, font=\\scriptsize] {$T$};", "    \\draw[omDef, thick] (0,0.4) -- (0.3,0.6) -- (1.6,0.9) -- (2.6,2.4) -- (2.8,2.45) -- (3.2,2.6);", "    \\draw[dashed] (0.3,0) -- (0.3,0.6); \\draw[dashed] (1.6,0) -- (1.6,0.9); \\draw[dashed] (2.6,0) -- (2.6,2.4); \\draw[dashed] (2.8,0) -- (2.8,2.45);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, below] at (0.95,0) {砖};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, below] at (2.1,0) {玻璃棉};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, left] at (0,0.4) {$T_{\\text{o}}$};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, right] at (3.2,2.6) {$T_{\\text{i}}$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 复合墙及其热等效电路：膜、砖、玻璃棉、", "膜依次串联。右图为温度分布——几乎全部温降", "落在热阻最大的一层——玻璃棉上，", "尽管它是最薄的一层。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[墙与窗]\\label{ex:b2:heat-conduction:wall}", "每平方米：砖厚 \\qty{20}{cm}，热导率为 \\qty{0.8}{W/m/K}，$R =", "\\qty{0.25}{m^2.K/W}$；两层膜，$1/8 + 1/25 = \\qty{0.165}{m^2.K/W}$：", "总热阻为 $0.415$，即 $U = 1/R = \\qty{2.4}{W/m^2/K}$，温差为 \\qty{20}{K} 时，", "热流为 \\qty{48}{W/m^2}。再加 \\qty{10}{cm} 厚的玻璃棉，$R =", "\\qty{2.5}{m^2.K/W}$：总热阻为 $2.9$，$U = \\qty{0.34}{W/m^2/K}$——", "降为原来的七分之一。单层玻璃，厚 \\qty{4}{mm}，热导率为 \\qty{1}{W/m/K}，", "几乎全是膜热阻：$R = 0.004 + 0.165$，$U \\approx \\qty{6}{W/m^2/K}$；", "在两层玻璃之间夹一层 \\qty{12}{mm} 的静止空气，增加热阻 $0.012/0.026 =", "\\qty{0.46}{m^2.K/W}$，使散热损失降为原来的三分之一以下。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{definition}[毕渥数]\\label{def:b2:heat-conduction:biot}", "对于与流体进行热交换的尺度为 $L$ 的固体，", "称\\emph{毕渥数}\\index{毕渥数}为", "\\[", "\\mathrm{Bi} = \\frac{hL}{\\lambda} = \\frac{\\text{内阻 } L/\\lambda S}{\\text{膜热阻 } 1/hS}", "\\]", "它比较两者。若 $\\mathrm{Bi} \\ll 1$，固体在任一时刻温度都是均匀的，", "整体一起降温，按指数规律", "以时间常数 $\\tau = \\rho c V/hS$ 变化；若 $\\mathrm{Bi} \\gg 1$，则", "表面温度与流体相同，内部则以自身的节奏导热，", "其特征时间为 $L^2/a$。", "\\end{definition}", ""]}